// Figure 4.7 — State chart: alert lifecycle
// Eraser: New diagram > Flow chart, paste this code.
direction right

Initial [shape: oval, color: black, label: ""]
Open [shape: rectangle, icon: alert-circle, color: yellow]
Confirmed fraud [shape: rectangle, icon: x-circle, color: red]
False positive [shape: rectangle, icon: check-circle, color: green]

Initial > Open: transaction scored with probability ≥ threshold
Open > Confirmed fraud: analyst or admin confirms (with note)
Open > False positive: analyst or admin dismisses (with note)
Confirmed fraud > False positive: admin changes decision (audited)
False positive > Confirmed fraud: admin changes decision (audited)
